      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The emotes are fixed animations inside the avatar. You can make it much longer. But that is for custom avatar. Default avatars or avatars with default emotes will use built-in animations.\nSo if you want dance longer, you need make own avatar. (And use VRChat account, not Steam account. Steam account wont allow it.)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
